detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/scripts/graph/_helpers.py:1-7, 89-93, 115-119` — Preserve LINK direction/storage and ARCHIVED semantics. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py:1-6, 31-48, 69-81` — Preserve why parent-repo discovery must be blocked. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py:1-15, 36-41` — Preserve live-holder informational status, stale-holder behavior, and host-global snapshot-root isolation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py:1-8, 345-356, 461-472, 628-639` — Preserve link-before-unlink safety, rollback-anchor refresh, non-reentrant lock rule, and continue-on-unrepairable behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_children_archive.py:1-6, 28-33, 76-89, 128-139, 172-189, 221-233, 255-278, 309-321` — Preserve archived filtering, transitive traversal, and redundant-edge-versus-cycle distinction. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_cycles.py:1-6, 32-36, 51-55, 72-76, 94-103, 129-140, 157-166, 181-189, 200-202, 262-271, 336-352, 383-417` — Preserve level-scoped traversal, hidden-dir exclusion, and accumulator semantics. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_hierarchy_adddep.py:1-6, 29-44, 88-96, 112-117, 161-170, 206-215, 247-257, 301-307, 361-365, 427-443, 487-493, 513-518, 546-551, 591-597, 625-631` — Preserve structural promotion, relation grammar, quiet MCP behavior, and returned redirect record. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_hierarchy_resolve.py:1-6, 26-35, 64-81, 111-129, 160-168, 194-201, 223-231, 251-255, 280-285, 337-385, 409-427, 451-456, 483-488, 508-513, 534-540` — Preserve NCA-based resolution, virtual-root behavior, ancestor refusal, non-blocking carve-out, and cycle termination. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_links_push.py:1-13, 26-48, 63-65, 106-108` — Preserve LINK-before-UNLINK tie-breaking. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_perf.py:1-6, 28-38, 68-73, 100-121, 158-169, 200-211` — Preserve mtime-sensitive cache invalidation and single-batch scan contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_traversal.py:1-6, 28-86, 144-157, 213-221, 248-270` — Preserve missing/deleted tombstones as satisfied blockers. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_unresolved_blocker.py:1-13, 35-39` — Preserve deliberate tombstone fail-open behavior. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/scripts/graph/_helpers.py tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_children_archive.py tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_cycles.py tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_hierarchy_adddep.py tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_hierarchy_resolve.py tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_links_push.py tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_perf.py tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_traversal.py tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_unresolved_blocker.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/_helpers.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_children_archive.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_cycles.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_hierarchy_adddep.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_hierarchy_resolve.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_links_push.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_perf.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_traversal.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/graph/test_graph_unresolved_blocker.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2d43-3c39-307e-4450"]],"no_file_impa